  "chapter_one": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "You're ready, then. Good. The camp can only hold you so long, and the world won't wait.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.isolde.chapter_one_0",
     "ticks": 122,
     "beats": [
      10,
      520,
      1540,
      2040,
      2630,
      3130,
      3640,
      4140,
      4680,
      5180,
      5730
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Take work from the Warden's Board, there by the dais. Coin, reputation, and a reason to see the wilds.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.isolde.chapter_one_1",
     "ticks": 139,
     "beats": [
      30,
      590,
      1140,
      1840,
      2390,
      3410,
      4070,
      4800,
      5350,
      5900,
      6460
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Then follow the tremors. Where the ground hums, an Edict has slipped loose. Bind it before it binds something else.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.isolde.chapter_one_2",
     "ticks": 156,
     "beats": [
      20,
      660,
      1300,
      2420,
      3060,
      3740,
      4380,
      5440,
      6080,
      6720,
      7350
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Find a shrine on the Pilgrim's road, and touch the waystone at one of the old landmarks. Then come back and tell me everything.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.isolde.chapter_one_3",
     "ticks": 153,
     "beats": [
      20,
      660,
      1300,
      2070,
      2720,
      3380,
      4020,
      5180,
