  "chapter_two": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "So it's true. An Edict came to your hand, and the shrine didn't turn you away.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.isolde.chapter_two_0",
     "ticks": 116,
     "beats": [
      0,
      490,
      1000,
      1900,
      2380,
      2860,
      3360,
      3930,
      4420,
      4900,
      5380
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Then I'll tell you what the Wardens don't tell everyone. Three old powers wait out there. The Bell-Ringer in the Hollow Cathedral. The King of Seconds, deep in his vault. And the Pilgrim, who walks and never arrives.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.isolde.chapter_two_1",
     "ticks": 285,
     "beats": [
      30,
      1150,
      2340,
      4030,
      5220,
      6840,
      8350,
      9660,
      11200,
      12670,
      13780
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "They're why the world is stuck. Free them, or face them. Either way, it starts to move again. And whatever they leave behind is yours to carry.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.isolde.chapter_two_2",
     "ticks": 196,
     "cue": "quietly",
     "beats": [
      20,
      800,
      1970,
      2890,
