      5050,
      5820,
      6540,
      7440,
      8190
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "The Pilgrim you'll hear before you see. Its footsteps wear roads into the grass. Wren can mark any of them for you.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.isolde.find_three_1",
     "ticks": 155,
     "beats": [
