  "chapter_three": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Listen. The bell is quiet. The clocks have stopped arguing. And somewhere, a stone pilgrim is finally sitting down.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.isolde.chapter_three_0",
     "ticks": 172,
     "cue": "quietly",
     "beats": [
      10,
      1300,
      1950,
      2990,
      3640,
      4770,
      5420,
      6180,
      6830,
      7480,
      8120
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "But the world has five more locks on it. Five Wardens, set to guard the lands when the old powers fell asleep. They never stopped guarding.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.isolde.chapter_three_1",
     "ticks": 183,
     "beats": [
      30,
      770,
      1520,
      2800,
      3540,
      4380,
      5120,
      5900,
      6640,
      7900,
      8730
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "A samurai of ash in the blossom country. A lich who will not stay dead. A colossus in the white waste. A sentinel under the sun. And a gilded warden who judges everyone who passes.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.isolde.chapter_three_2",
     "ticks": 264,
     "beats": [
      20,
      1140,
      2250,
      3810,
      5470,
      6610,
      7930,
      9420,
      10520,
      11680,
      12760
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Each one has a trial before it will even face you. The keepers know the ways in. Ask them.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.isolde.chapter_three_3",
     "ticks": 130,
     "beats": [
      20,
      560,
      1090,
      1620,
      2160,
      2690,
      3540,
      4080,
      4610,
      5530,
      6080
     ]
    }
   ],
